# --- Ansys Workbench project files (large, binary, solver-generated) ---
# These are auto-regenerated every time the project is opened/solved in
# Workbench, produce no meaningful diffs, and can easily reach hundreds of
# MB to GB. Keep only the .wbpj launcher if you want the project to be
# reopenable, or exclude everything and keep just the report + key images.
*_files/
dp0/
*.mechdb
*.engd
*.rst
*.aapresults
*.DSP
*.mntr
*.cnd
*.PCS
*.err
solve.out
ds.dat
act.dat
designPoint.wbdp

# --- SpaceClaim / Workbench backup & session folders ---
.*_files.backup/
session_files/

# --- LaTeX build artifacts ---
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.bbl
*.blg

# --- OS / editor junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
